          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;at the end of season 3, catra chooses to go with the princesses back to brightmoon. adora is absolutely furious with catra for activating the portal, and catra needs to prove herself worthy of the princesses trust again. but what happens when she starts getting closer than expected with the most prestigious princess of them all?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AU where catra joins the rebellion instead of running off with hordak at the end of s3. i really wanted to make catra a good guy sooner than s5ðŸ˜­&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
